    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forester: First Step</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense first-person horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forester, finishing his shift, receives a distress call\u2014his partner has gone missing near an abandoned cabin. He decides to investigate alone. As night falls, the darkness grows denser. Leaving his car at the trail leading to the cabin, he continues on foot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short first-person horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped. The doors are locked, there's no way out. The mysterious cabin hides a secret waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find keys, interact with objects, solve puzzles, and move forward. But be careful\u2014every action could lead to inevitable doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours: what will you do in this unknown place? And what will you definitely avoid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Cabin:</strong> Every decision shapes the unfolding events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> What do these walls conceal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:</strong> Move, explore, interact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> A short experience allows for multiple playthroughs, uncovering different plot twists and endings.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forester: First Step</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense first-person horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forester, finishing his shift, receives a distress call\u2014his partner has gone missing near an abandoned cabin. He decides to investigate alone. As night falls, the darkness grows denser. Leaving his car at the trail leading to the cabin, he continues on foot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short first-person horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped. The doors are locked, there's no way out. The mysterious cabin hides a secret waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find keys, interact with objects, solve puzzles, and move forward. But be careful\u2014every action could lead to inevitable doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours: what will you do in this unknown place? And what will you definitely avoid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Cabin:</strong> Every decision shapes the unfolding events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> What do these walls conceal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:</strong> Move, explore, interact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> A short experience allows for multiple playthroughs, uncovering different plot twists and endings.</p></li></ul>",
